The package whiteoutlib provides CMake targets:

    find_package(WhiteoutLib CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE WhiteoutLib::whiteout_lib)

When installed with features:

    find_package(WhiteoutLib CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS casc mpq)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE
        WhiteoutLib::whiteout_lib
        WhiteoutLib::whiteout_casc
        WhiteoutLib::whiteout_mpq)

Each component corresponds to the matching vcpkg feature
(`whiteoutlib[casc]`, `whiteoutlib[mpq]`).
